1(c) Compare the performance and efficiency of both algorithms
(table from the book)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Parameter         | BFS                        | IDDFS
Strategy          | Level-wise search          | Depth-limited DFS repeatedly
Data Structure    | Queue                      | Stack / Recursion
Time Complexity   | O(bd)                      | O(bd)
Space Complexity  | O(bd)                      | O(b·d)
Memory Usage      | High                       | Low
Performance       | Fast, finds solution quickly | Slower due to repeated searches
Efficiency        | Time efficient but memory heavy | Memory efficient but time consuming
Optimal           | Yes                        | Yes
